ORGANISER RESOURCES

Supporting Better OCR Events

The Obstacle Course Racing Association of Ireland (OCRA ÉIREANN) wants to support race organisers with practical resources that help improve obstacle sport events across Ireland.

This section brings together information relevant to organisers delivering recreational, competitive, sanctioned and qualification events.


Event Planning

Planning an obstacle race involves considerably more than designing obstacles and opening registration.

Organisers need to consider areas including:

- Venue
- Course design
- Participant numbers
- Event schedule
- Obstacles
- Staffing
- Volunteers
- Medical provision
- Safety
- Timing
- Results
- Athlete communication
- Competition rules
- Emergency procedures


